{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 9, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a plan for Japan a journey grand\nA tapestry of wonders across the land.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where new adventures thrive.\nTo Shinjuku's heights a swift train shall convey\nWhere towering structures greet the dawning day.\nA hotel awaits a chamber fit for kings\nThen wander forth where vibrant Tokyo sings.\nDinner awaits a feast of taste untold\nSushi and ramen stories to unfold.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Ancient Heart**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a journey we take\nWhere Senso-ji's grandeur doth hearts awake.\nThrough Nakamise-dori stalls we shall roam\nSeeking trinkets treasures and a sweet home.\nThen Ueno Park a verdant space to see\nWith museums art and birds in liberty.\nIn Akihabara's glow electric bright\nGames and gadgets fill the day and night.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Mountain Grace**\n\nA mountain journey to Hakone we bend\nWhere nature's beauty doth forever extend.\nLake Ashi's waters reflect the sky so blue\nMount Fuji's peak a breathtaking view.\nA cruise upon the lake a peaceful sight\nThen volcanic hot springs a soothing delight.\nArt museums too a cultural embrace\nHakone's wonders leave a lasting trace.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we swiftly glide\nWhere ancient temples in splendor reside.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermilion dream\nA thousand torii a vibrant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera's stage a wooden grace\nWith panoramic vistas time cannot erase.\nGion's district geishas softly tread\nMysteries whispered secrets gently spread.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden hue\nReflecting beauty forever fresh and new.\nRyoan-ji's garden stones a tranquil art\nA meditation space to soothe the heart.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove a verdant maze\nWhere sunlight filters in ethereal rays.\nA tea ceremony a ritual refined\nA taste of Japan for body and mind.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Temples Old**\n\nTo Nara we journey deer roam free\nIn Nara Park a joyful sight to see.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha's might\nA colossal statue bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns softly glow\nA path to blessings where good spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto memories to keep\nOf ancient wonders buried strong and deep.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure's Sad Reprieve**\n\nFrom Kansai's airport our farewell we speak\nTo Japan's beauty memories we seek.\nA journey ended yet the spirit flies\nWith tales of wonder mirrored in our eyes.\nUntil we meet again in lands afar\nJapan's enchantment a guiding star.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.009764053858816624}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5308548808097839}, {"token": "▁plan", "logprob": -1.8127150535583496}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0020281951874494553}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.053098808974027634}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.012966837733983994}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.2796243727207184}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.06520823389291763}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0006675875629298389}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.18416158854961395}, {"token": "▁tapestry", "logprob": -1.7519500255584717}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.006734176073223352}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -0.7466732859611511}, {"token": "▁across", "logprob": -0.7219961285591125}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.0001530530134914443}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.08869817852973938}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0008967668982222676}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.017411593347787857}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.007163554430007935}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.3856746256351471}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.31932204961776733}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.001814268296584487}, {"token": "▁in", "lo